      "title": "Quarry drill rigs",
      "h1": "Marini Quarry drill rigs",
      "description": "Marini's quarry drilling units are used to drill the holes the diamond wire passes through, for core drilling and for large holes for so-called blind cuts. There are hydraulic models with a hydraulic ",
